{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5c5fa93377b4fadef32c6f63a48ddeb70cda9a8e7f2b5babb5c10dfae01b6968", "ja": "これは……『昏き星、遠い月』の台本？\nうわ、すごい書き込みだな。", "zh": "这是……『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的剧本？\n哇，里面写了好多注记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "28509898569a04b0005da43e8cc5c6dcea9fd960812bb5800c0b5571759f398b", "ja": "舞台はもう終わったけど、いちおう届けておくか。\nええと、書き込みからすると、持ち主は……。", "zh": "表演虽然已经结束了，但还是把这送回去吧。\n我看看，照注记来看，这本剧本的主人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1004_se", "source_sha256": "3a39d65a9e257a09dba8ba313e22f361fa16a436a844d53adea33765d9923175", "ja": "キィ……", "zh": "嘎叽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "99a7026820ea6eabeca90be4b6a1bdec3ee12a1ff485dcb80813bf7293f9fe79", "ja": "……{$P$}さん～？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6445a0a311dc9f7c123250630b0e86b51e913f9802014c285b9942c42a2bd526", "ja": "！？　き、急に体の自由が……！\nこのプレッシャーは……！？", "zh": "！？身、身体突然动弹不得……！\n这股压迫感是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "7ed047a361776e4313aebf32eaecfb51ba3eb7e8fd9c6aaf64401daee7296ab0", "ja": "聖母の持ち物を、勝手にのぞき見るなんて……\nこれは、お仕置きが必要なようですね～？", "zh": "居然偷看圣母的东西……\n看来有必要惩罚你一下了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7f37c6cfacfc7c94c90fcc7c07b639a430812d8fc2dd4298e0dbd529ee0aa9b3", "ja": "いや、書き込みの内容は見てない！\nただ熱心だなって、感心していただけで……。", "zh": "不，我没有看注记的内容！\n就只是觉得写下这些的人很认真，感到敬佩而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "6b9bf4d8d37930fe0f1ad2e8bd093f7369f87aa54bdcc43365f1a8a1bac68aab", "ja": "どうやら、本当のようですね～。なら今回だけは、\n許してあげましょう～。でも、2度はありませんよ～？", "zh": "看来你好像没有说谎～\n那这次，我就原谅你吧～不过，下不为例喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6e971282057203cec240eb1fa330cd1ad1527bcbc2d1b0ad124feb7e874634a6", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……ふぅ。けど、これだけ\n読み込んでいたらこそ、あの熱演があったんだな。", "zh": "谢、谢谢……呼。不过，正因为你熟读了这么多遍，\n才能成就那么精彩的演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "ec314079777f02fc6b170797e6bc2fbe4774184bf15265989a57bbdd2c8db4a1", "ja": "そうですね～。千鶴さんがアレクサンドラに思い入れが\nあるように、私にも、思い入れはありますから～。", "zh": "对呀～就像千鹤姊对亚历山大特别有感情一样，\n我自己也是有一些共鸣的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b41527b8d9f57e35c10911e79e5fc13d4e5a753c279c4e4a2ad5670f5a3131e3", "ja": "そうなのか。\n朋花は、クリスのどんなところに思い入れがあるんだ？", "zh": "这样啊。\n朋花是对克利丝的哪里产生了共鸣呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "e0c8af52a7e08abd37f9413ba8d4d28e5a0304b0874b3b179e4deb9474b76f5c", "ja": "そうですね～。クリスは、\n長い時を生きてきたヴァンパイアですが……。", "zh": "这个嘛～克利丝，\n虽然是已经活了漫长岁月的吸血鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "c1108e4342c98337fa7dfcc997bbae5cf7e8feaa7b5eba2b90e3e4981a196469", "ja": "ごく普通の、人間の少年……少女であるエドガーと、\n運命的な出会いをしますよね～？", "zh": "但他和平凡的人类少年……少女艾德嘉，\n有了命运般的邂逅不是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6b11ad500efff32ba8572a6dde37ba675a84e7faadfa1521d0fbe530e183bff9", "ja": "ああ。クリスはエドガーと出会って、\nお互いに少しずつ惹かれあっていくな。", "zh": "嗯，克利丝和艾德嘉邂逅以后，\n两人的心就变得越来越靠近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "d5b89dd06b6dd364772486a50bde5aae4fb2a75ca044fe7e7bb535211afa4ab7", "ja": "クリスにとって人間は、食料……。けどエドガーとの\n出会いで、クリスの世界が少しずつ変わっていく……。", "zh": "对克利丝而言，人类是粮食……但和艾德嘉的邂逅，\n一点一滴改变了克利丝的世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "d9aeee1dbfa9de105492f8d866e364a38f414fd9d4bb7123608d591023fe3034", "ja": "私も、同じように……ひとつの出会いによって、\n世界の見え方が、少し変わったと感じていますから～。", "zh": "我也和他一样……因为一场邂逅，\n觉得自己对世界的看法，产生了一些改变～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b85322910e28b98b922a406a7ea06faaa82d65e17e9c9223eaadd1af14b3e8d2", "ja": "なるほど。劇場で出会った仲間は、\n朋花にとってそれくらい大切なものなんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，在剧场邂逅的伙伴，\n对朋花而言是这么重要的存在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "222ee49fbb583026285635904936e8e92b3b3ff19b6944bb5d53bcf780d7e3ee", "ja": "そうですね～。たしかに、それもありますけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛～这样讲确实也没错，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0043_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "15d89ff0994c7b01323b1bb6a0b1e07508d6f1fa07391c25dc5f7ead65810281", "ja": "なんでもありません～。{$P$}さんは\nこれからも、聖母のために尽くしてくださいね～。", "zh": "没什么～{$P$}先生，\n今后也要为了圣母鞠躬尽瘁喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
